OL,3,ATrump in Asia ahead of talks with
OL,4,ARussian and Chinese presidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has arrived
OL,7,Fin the Philippines' capital on the
OL,8,Ffirst leg of a trip to Asia, which will
OL,9,Fend in a meeting in China with its
OL,10,FPresident Xi Jinping and his Russian
OL,11,Fcounterpart Vladimir Putin.
OL,13,FA red carpet was rolled out for Trump
OL,14,Fas he walked off Air Force One in
OL,15,FManila. A band played one of his
OL,16,Ffavourite songs, Y.M.C.A., before he
OL,17,Fwas whisked away by helicopter to a
OL,18,Fhotel.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
